    "body": "Salvation (which I help maintain) actually has APIs for parsing both [single policies](https://github.com/shapesecurity/salvation/blob/7256d9fd17b508651ca5e2d8469925372cb30204/src/main/java/com/shapesecurity/salvation/Parser.java#L132) and [lists of policies](https://github.com/shapesecurity/salvation/blob/7256d9fd17b508651ca5e2d8469925372cb30204/src/main/java/com/shapesecurity/salvation/Parser.java#L154). The fact that the Nu HTML checker disallows lists means they've chosen to use the API for a single policy, I believe.",
