    "updated_at": "2020-01-17T14:33:42Z",
    "body": "There's going to be parser input differences at least as one is a byte sequence and the other is a string.\r\n\r\nI would also expect combining differences. Ideally for HTTP we combine first and then parse, but I don't think that's workable for `http-equiv` as we cannot wait for the last one to arrive.",
